 Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 CROMER, MARQUEZ, SMITH, FLOODING, TORNADOES, STORM\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM\par \par \uc2 ABORTION BAN, TRUMP, HAMILTON, MARTINEZ, HERNANDEZ, GIBSON\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ARIZONA ABORTION RIGHTS SHOWDOWN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REPUBLICAN LAWMAKERS BLOCK REPEAL OD 1864 ABORTION LAW\par \par \uc2 FISA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HOUSE CONSERVATIVES BLOCK FOREIGN SURVEILLANCE BILL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SPEAKER JOHNSON FACES GOP REVOLT AS FISA DEADLINE LOOMS\par \par \uc2 DELAY, TRIAL, \uc2 TRUMP\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL, IRAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDEAST TENSIONS ESCALATING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: U.S. WARNS IRAN MAY RETALIATE AGAINST ISRAEL IN COMING DAYS\par \par \uc2 PARKER, ZWERNER, TOSCANO, GUN SHOW LOOPHOLE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FORMER SCHOOL OFFICIAL CHARGED IN TEACHER'S SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: EX-ASSISTANT PRINCIPAL INDICTED ON EIGHT COUNTS OF FELONY CHILD NEGLECT\par \par \uc2 OHTANI, MIZUHARA, THEFT, PLEA DEAL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PLEA DEAL IN MLB GAMBLING SCANDAL?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REPORT: OHTANI'S EX-INTERPRETER FACING FEDERAL CHARGES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 RICE, ARREST, CAR CRASH, QUINN\par \par \uc2 DESANTIS, BREWSTER, HUDAK, PORCH PIRATE, THEFT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FLORIDA PORCH PIRATE CRACKDOWN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOVERNOR SIGNS A BILL TO TOUGHEN PENALTIES FOR STEALING PACKAGES, RETAIL THEFT\par \par \uc2 RESCUE, RIP CURRENT, DESOUZA, SMITH, TARNOW\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HEART-POUNDING RIP CURRENT RESCUE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SWIMMER SAVED FROM WATER & REVIVED BY PARAMEDICS\par \par \uc2 COSTCO, GOLD BARS, HERZOG, EDWARDS, BEAUREGARD, YANG\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GMA CONSUMER ALERT\par \par \uc2 PENGUINS, CLIFF DIVING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PLAY OF THE DAY\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Back now with our "Play of the Day" and something that has never been caught on camera before, baby penguins cliff diving. Morgan Norwood is here to show us a little bit more. Good morning, Morgan.\par \par \uc2 MORGAN NORWOOD (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Hey, good morning to you. I mean, guys, it is truly incredible. Okay, so quick science lesson.\par \par \uc2 MORGAN NORWOOD (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (VO) When penguins are around 6 months old, they form large groups and they make their way from the frozen land to the surrounding sea ice. They usually slip a foot or two down the water for their first swim ever. But in rare cases, they end up at the edge of a cliff. You see it there, dozens of feet from the water's surface. Now, National Geographic, they were able, for the first time, to capture this rare and remarkable phenomenon where they jump off the cliff. Basically, we're going to wait for it in just a second. There they go. The first brave little penguin made its plunge and many others following. And, of course, we're going to have more, including how that photographer managed to get those rare shots, look at that, one after another, coming up in our next hour.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Take me to the slide. I want to slide to the water, too.\par \par \uc2 MORGAN NORWOOD (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I know. Wasn't that a dive?\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) What's going through their heads?\par \par \uc2 MORGAN NORWOOD (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) All tens.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I know.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) I can only imagine what's going through their head. I know what's going through mine. That's a long way down.\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) But that is so rare.\par \par \uc2 MORGAN NORWOOD (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) What were you doing at 6 months old?\par \par \uc2 ROBIN ROBERTS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah, I know.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Don't remember. That was a great footage, though.\par \par \uc2 GEORGE STEPHANOPOULOS (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Yeah.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Thanks to our friends at Nat Geo. That was awesome. We'll be right back.\par \par \uc2 MICHAEL STRAHAN (ABC NEWS)\par \par \uc2 (OC) Wow.\par \par \uc2 COMMERCIAL BREAK\par \par \uc2 Document GMA0000020240430ek4b0000g\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 INTRODUCTION TO THE 8:30 HALF HOUR\b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 April 2024\par \uc2 ABC News: Good Morning America\par \uc2 GMA\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2024, American Broadcasting Companies, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 CROMER, MARQUEZ, SMITH, FLOODING, TORNADOES, STORM\par \par \uc2 WEATHER, TRACK, STORM\par \par \uc2 ABORTION BAN, TRUMP, HAMILTON, MARTINEZ, HERNANDEZ, GIBSON\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: ARIZONA ABORTION RIGHTS SHOWDOWN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REPUBLICAN LAWMAKERS BLOCK REPEAL OD 1864 ABORTION LAW\par \par \uc2 FISA\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: HOUSE CONSERVATIVES BLOCK FOREIGN SURVEILLANCE BILL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: SPEAKER JOHNSON FACES GOP REVOLT AS FISA DEADLINE LOOMS\par \par \uc2 DELAY, TRIAL, \uc2 TRUMP\par \par \uc2 ISRAEL, IRAN\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: MIDEAST TENSIONS ESCALATING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: U.S. WARNS IRAN MAY RETALIATE AGAINST ISRAEL IN COMING DAYS\par \par \uc2 PARKER, ZWERNER, TOSCANO, GUN SHOW LOOPHOLE\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FORMER SCHOOL OFFICIAL CHARGED IN TEACHER'S SHOOTING\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: EX-ASSISTANT PRINCIPAL INDICTED ON EIGHT COUNTS OF FELONY CHILD NEGLECT\par \par \uc2 OHTANI, MIZUHARA, THEFT, PLEA DEAL\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: PLEA DEAL IN MLB GAMBLING SCANDAL?\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: REPORT: OHTANI'S EX-INTERPRETER FACING FEDERAL CHARGES\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: GOOD MORNING AMERICA\par \par \uc2 RICE, ARREST, CAR CRASH, QUINN\par \par \uc2 DESANTIS, BREWSTER, HUDAK, PORCH PIRATE, THEFT\par \par \uc2 GRAPHICS: FLORIDA PORCH PIRATE CRACKDOW